{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05等短停留页仍有较多同时出现的静态感受词，第一眼扫读不如X的左右分栏轻快，个别意象也略显堆叠。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键心理词有加亮，观众可以先抓住每段的核心意思；标注到时出现的感受又把音乐细节分散到对应时刻，不必一次读完。它也更清楚地连起了从害怕给对方负担、因对方没有退开而放松，到渴望互相依靠、害怕失去，最后接受无法保证永远的心理变化。X的叙述更口语化，部分句子读起来更自然，但感受词多为同时呈现的概括性短语，音乐过程和情绪转折的细腻层次不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f50422f3-1c01-4006-b9ad-d0e51d5738f9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005837886955Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:59:47.326436+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "10f5b5096020af80057cab65367ec35fe7c7a1f511cac6abc91fdf75f3856dae", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at